#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Floppy"
msgstr "Disketa"

#. Tag: author
#: index.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Alexander.Neundorf; &Alexander.Neundorf.mail;"
msgstr "&Alexander.Neundorf; &Alexander.Neundorf.mail;"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: index.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ULOGE_PREVODIOCA"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The floppy ioslave gives you easy access to the floppy disk drives installed "
"on your system."
msgstr ""
"Disketa ioslave vam daje lagan pristup floppy diskovima instaliranim na "
"vašem sistemu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The drive letter becomes the first subdirectory in the floppy &URL;. Let's "
"say there is a file <filename>logo.png</filename> on your floppy disk in "
"drive A, then the &URL; will be <userinput><command>floppy:</"
"command><replaceable>/a/logo.png</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"Slovo diska postaje prvi poddirektorij na vašoj disketi &URL;. Možemo reći "
"da postoji datoteka <filename>logo.png</filename> na vašem floppyu u disku "
"A, onda će &URL; <userinput><command>floppy:</command><replaceable>/a/logo."
"png</replaceable></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to access drive B, <userinput><command>floppy:/b</command></"
"userinput> will do it. <command>floppy:/</command> is a shortcut for "
"<command>floppy:/a</command>."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite pristupiti disku B, <userinput><command>floppy:/b</command></"
"userinput> će to uraditi. <command>floppy:/</command> je kratica za "
"<command>floppy:/a</command>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that <command>floppy:/logo.png</command> means you have a disk drive "
"named <filename>logo.png</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da <command>disketa:/logo.png</command> znači da imate disk sa "
"imenom <filename>logo.png</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use it you need to have the mtools package installed, and the floppy "
"ioslave supports everything the various mtools command line utilities "
"support. You don't have to mount your floppy disks, simply enter "
"<userinput>floppy:/</userinput> in any &kde; 3.x app and you will be able to "
"read from and write to your floppy drive."
msgstr ""
"Da biste ga koristili morate imati instaliran paket mtools, a zahvat flopija "
"podržava sve različite mtools komandne linije koje komunalije podržavaju. Ne "
"morate montirati diskete, jednostavno unesite <userinput> floppy: / </"
"userinput> u bilo kojem &kde; 3.x aplikaciji, a vi ćete moći čitati i pisati "
"na vaš floppy disk."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It also works with USB sticks, ZIP and JAZ drives. You can use "
"<command>floppy:/u</command> for the USB stick and <command>floppy:/z</"
"command> for the zip drive, for example. To make this work, you might need "
"to adjust your <filename>/etc/mtools</filename> file. See the manpage for "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Također radi sa USB stikovima, ZIP i JAZ pogonima. Možete koristiti "
"<command> floppy: / U </command> za USB stick i <command> floppy: / z </"
"command> za zip disk, na primjer. Da bi ovo radilo, možda će biti potrebno "
"da prilagodite <filename> / etc / mtools </filename>. Pogledajte man "
"stranicu za dokumentaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The ioslave gives read and write access to the floppy drive, but not "
"simultaneously. While you can read and write to the floppy during the same "
"session, reading and writing have to happen one after the other, not at the "
"same time."
msgstr ""
"Zahvat pruža pristup za čitanje i pisanje na flopi jedinicu, ali ne "
"istovremeno. Iako možete čitati i pisati na disketu u istoj sjednici, "
"čitanje i pisanje bi  moralo da se desi jedna za drugom, a ne u isto vrijeme."

